{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "nav",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Experience 启动｜流程图\n类与资产关系见 [[GGYGO_结构_GameFeature.canvas|结构图]]；[[计划_GameFeature]]。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 1670,
      "height": 130,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "init",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "1. GameMode::InitGame 选择 Experience。\n\n调用：GameMode::InitGame → 选择 UGGYGOExperienceDefinition；提供插件 URL 与默认 SquadMembers。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 351,
      "width": 390,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "features",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "2. 按 Experience 激活 GameFeature；PendingGameFeatureCount 记录未完成项。\n\n调用：GameMode::ActivateGameFeatures → UGameFeaturesSubsystem::LoadAndActivateGameFeaturePlugin(URL, Callback)。",
      "x": 470,
      "y": 351,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "wait",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "3. 玩家进入时若插件尚未结清，暂存玩家；每个回调递减计数。\n\n调用：GameMode::HandleStartingNewPlayer_Implementation 把未就绪 Controller 排队；OnGameFeatureActivated 递减计数。",
      "x": 970,
      "y": 351,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "roster",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "4. 就绪后选择 Roster → 本地预设 → Experience 默认编队。\n\n调用：SquadPresets::ResolveActivePresetRoster(OutRoster) → SquadComponent::SetRoster；无结果回退 Experience 默认成员。",
      "x": 1470,
      "y": 351,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "slot",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "5. 先创建各 CharacterSlot，基础属性和 AbilitySet 就绪。\n\n调用：GameMode::SpawnSquadForPlayer → SpawnSquadSlot；Slot::InitializeForPawnData 给 ASC 授予能力。",
      "x": 970,
      "y": 824,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "avatar",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "6. 再创建 Pawn、注入 Slot ASC、Possess 出战成员。\n\n调用：GameMode::SpawnSquadMember → PawnExtension::SetPawnData → Slot::AttachAvatar → Controller::Possess。",
      "x": 1470,
      "y": 824,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "1"
    }
  ],
  "edges": [
    {
      "id": "e1",
      "fromNode": "init",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "features",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "读取插件列表"
    },
    {
      "id": "e2",
      "fromNode": "features",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "wait",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "等待异步结果"
    },
    {
      "id": "e3",
      "fromNode": "wait",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "roster",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "计数归零（含失败）"
    },
    {
      "id": "e4",
      "fromNode": "roster",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "slot",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "确定成员"
    },
    {
      "id": "e5",
      "fromNode": "slot",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "avatar",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "ASC 先于 Avatar 绑定"
    }
  ]
}
